Hershey Fonts — src/plot/fontHersheySimplex.ts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The "Hershey Simplex" text face is converted from the Roman Simplex set of the
Hershey Fonts, file hershey-fonts/rowmans.jhf in Kamal Mostafa's hershey-fonts
distribution (https://github.com/kamalmostafa/hershey-fonts, commit
1356bf2f83d380fcef68c887e88675eb9d445d86), which takes its font data from
http://emergent.unpythonic.net/software/hershey. Only the glyph data is used;
none of that distribution's GPL-licensed library or tools code is included.

The notice that accompanies the font data, quoted verbatim:

